(Japanese: '''南井健太''' ''Kenta Minamii'') is the main character of [[Aim to Be a Card Master!!]], a manga series taking place in the real world. Kenta is a player of the [[Pokémon Trading Card Game]]. After being bored of playing with his friends, he goes, at the advice of his friend [[Natsuki Shibata]], to the {{OBP|Pokémon Center|store}} in {{wp|Tokyo}} where he meets a young boy named [[Shou Okabe]] who defeats him easily. He decides to train until he's good enough to become a champion of the game.

